OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe odd
OL,6,Fshower possible at first, otherwise
OL,7,Fdry with sunny then clear spells in
OL,8,Fthe evening. Cloud and showery rain
OL,9,Fspreads east overnight, occasionally
OL,10,Fheavy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy with some showers at
OL,13,Ffirst, soon clearing in the morning.
OL,14,FThen dry with bright spells in the
OL,15,Feast, cloudier in the west with the
OL,16,Fodd shower. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
