OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and variable cloud over the
OL,7,Fweekend, mainly dry but the odd shower
OL,8,Flight possible on Saturday. Likely
OL,9,Fturning wet and windy on Monday.
